      "say": "Line one: the seven place words. In, on, under, next to, between, behind, in front of. Next to is two words, in front of is three, and between needs two things. [click] Line two: in means inside a space with sides around it. On means touching a surface, and that includes a wall. [click] Line three: in English the preposition comes before the noun, the opposite of Mongolian, and it needs the: in the box. Close: Now you can say exactly where anything is, in a room, a house or a street. [click] Closing line (spoken, never on the slide): Одоо энэ видеоны доорх дасгалаар мэдлэгээ шалгаарай. Hold the slide silently for three seconds.",
